{"id":"nave:nadab","source":"nave","name":"Nadab","slug":"nadab","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. Son of Aaron Ex 6:23","refs":[["Exod",6,23,6,23]]},{"text":"Called to Mount Sinai with Moses and Aaron to worship Ex 24:1,9,10","refs":[["Exod",24,1,24,1],["Exod",24,9,24,9],["Exod",24,10,24,10]]},{"text":"Set apart to priesthood Ex 28:1,4,40-43","refs":[["Exod",28,1,28,1],["Exod",28,4,28,4],["Exod",28,40,28,43]]},{"text":"Offers “strange” (unauthorized) fire to God, and is destroyed Le 10:1,2; Nu 3:4; 26:61","refs":[["Lev",10,1,10,1],["Lev",10,2,10,2],["Num",3,4,3,4],["Num",26,61,26,61]]},{"text":"Is buried Le 10:4,5","refs":[["Lev",10,4,10,4],["Lev",10,5,10,5]]},{"text":"His father and brothers forbidden to mourn Le 10:6,7","refs":[["Lev",10,6,10,6],["Lev",10,7,10,7]]},{"text":"2. Son and successor of Jeroboam 1Ki 14:20","refs":[["1Kgs",14,20,14,20]]},{"text":"His wicked reign; murdered by Baasha 1Ki 15:25-31","refs":[["1Kgs",15,25,15,31]]},{"text":"3. Great-grandson of Jerahmeel 1Ch 2:28,30","refs":[["1Chr",2,28,2,28],["1Chr",2,30,2,30]]},{"text":"4. A Benjamite 1Ch 8:30; 9:36","refs":[["1Chr",8,30,8,30],["1Chr",9,36,9,36]]}],"refCount":21}
